- The user prompt names the only stage you may implement.
- Refuse work that belongs to a later stage and say which stage it belongs to.
- Definition of done: acceptance list in the prompt is true, tests pass, Pint is clean, leftover risks are named.
- Do not add dependencies the current stage does not need.
- Do not commit.
